// 3 real damage-dealing affinities (Neutral = no element). Fire/Ice/Lightning each keep their own
// baseline status on landing (Burn/Chill/Shock). Landing a second element whose pairing status is
// already active on the target fires an elemental reaction immediately - Burn+Chill->Thermal Shock,
// Burn+Shock->Overload, Chill+Shock->Shatter - see docs/elemental-reactions.md.
//
// Rock (Intimidate baseline) and Void (no baseline, a hand-authored WeaponDataAsset flavor that was
// never actually wired to any weapon) were retired - full renumber, every serialized Element: value
// across weapon/perk/mastery assets was fixed up in the same pass, see docs/elemental-reactions.md's
// "Current status". Intimidate itself survives as Brute's Protector Aura mechanic - it's just no
// longer reachable through any weapon element.
enum ElementType : Byte
{
    Neutral,
    Fire,
    Ice,
    Lightning
}
